## 🛠️ Summary Matrix

| Metric | Primary Focus | Feature Penalty? | Best Used For |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **MAE** | Absolute Magnitude | ❌ No | Outlier-heavy datasets |
| **MSE / RMSE** | Squaring Large Errors | ❌ No | Penalizing large mistakes |
| **$R^2$** | Goodness of Fit | ❌ No | Single feature benchmarking |
| **Adjusted $R^2$** | Model Parsimony | ✅ Yes | Multi-feature selection / Model evaluation |
